ttps://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114712","id":3723669384,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d8q-I","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-08T12:32:37Z","updated_at":"2026-01-08T12:33:45Z","body":"> There is also this notification that needs to be changed:\r\n> \r\n> (`servers/rendering/storage/camera_attributes_storage.cpp`)\r\n\r\nRegarding this, I found out that it does not have a method to detect if Mobile is being used. This is the current code:\r\n```C++\r\n#ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED\r\n\tif (OS::get_singleton()->get_current_rendering_method() == \"gl_compatibility\" && p_enable) {\r\n\t\tWARN_PRINT_ONCE_ED(\"Auto-exposure is only available when using the Forward+ renderer.\");\r\n\t}\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nI have replaced it with:\r\n```C++\r\n#ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED\r\n\tif (OS::get_singleton()->get_current_rendering_method() == \"gl_compatibility\" && p_enable) {\r\n\t\tWARN_PRINT_ONCE_ED(\"Auto-exposure is only available when using the Forward+ renderer.\");\r\n\t}\r\n\tif (OS::get_singleton()->get_current_rendering_method() == \"mobile\" && p_enable) {\r\n\t\tWARN_PRINT_ED(\"Auto-exposure is only available when using the Forward+ renderer\");\r\n\t}\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nWe could also do (I have no idea if this would work):\r\n```C++\r\n#ifdef DEBUG_ENABLED\r\n\tif (OS::get_singleton()->get_current_rendering_method() == \"gl_compatibility\" || \"mobile\" && p_enable) {\r\n\t\tWARN_PRINT_ONCE_ED(\"Auto-exposure is only available when using the Forward+ renderer.\");\r\n\t}\r\n#endif\r\n```\r\nI was wondering if this should be done. Let me know what you think!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723669384/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3723681122","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114712#issuecomment-3723681122","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114712","id":3723681122,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7d8t1i","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","